+# Knowledge Read API Usage Guide
+
+## Endpoint
+`GET /brain/knowledge/read`
+
+## Query Parameters
+| Parameter | Type | Description |
+|-----------|------|-------------|
+| `query` | string | Keyword search across text, id, kind, source, session_id |
+| `kind` | string | Filter by record kind (e.g., "session_fragment") |
+| `source` | string | Filter by record source |
+| `session_id` | string | Filter by session ID |
+| `limit` | integer | Max records to return (1-100, default 10) |
+| `offset` | integer | Records to skip (default 0) |
+| `include_full_text` | boolean | Return full text instead of preview |
+
+## Guarantees
+- **no_write**: true — endpoint never writes to memory
+- **faiss_used**: false — reads from JSONL directly, no FAISS index required
+- **promotion**: false — no automatic memory promotion occurs
+
+## Example Requests
+
+### Search by keyword
+```bash
curl -s "http://127.0.0.1:8090/brain/knowledge/read?query=session&limit=5"
```
+
+### Filter by kind
+```bash
curl -s "http://127.0.0.1:8090/brain/knowledge/read?kind=canary&limit=1"
```
+
+### Filter by source
+```bash
curl -s "http://127.0.0.1:8090/brain/knowledge/read?source=front_real_canary_exec_01"
```
+
+## Example Response (summary mode)
+```json
{
  "status": "ok",
  "total_count": 1,
  "returned_count": 1,
  "limit": 10,
  "offset": 0,
  "query": null,
  "filters": {},
