    {
      "id": "canary-00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001",
      "kind": "canary",
      "source": "front_real_canary_exec_01",
      "session_id": "canary_session",
      "created_utc": "2026-01-01T00:00:00Z",
      "text_preview": "Canary record for controlled real write verification...",
      "metadata": {}
    }
  ],
  "errors": [],
  "no_write": true,
  "faiss_used": false,
  "promotion": false
}
```
+
+## Notes
+- This guide is a **patch artifact only**; it has not been applied to the repository.
+- The actual application requires human review via FRONT-REAL-PATCH-APPLICATION-REVIEW-01.
+- No chain-of-thought or reasoning is exposed in API responses.
